The code includes a critical comment (lines 177-179):
```typescript
// The SDK only accepts 'sonnet' | 'opus' | 'haiku' | 'inherit' for model.
// Arbitrary strings (e.g. "openai/gpt-5.2") are silently rejected, causing
// the agent to not be registered.
```

This means **OpenAI models cannot be used directly as agents**; they're only supported as the orchestrator model.

