The sidecar TypeScript code implements a **thin, transparent proxy** that:
- Forwards all Claude Agent SDK messages as SSE events to the backend
- Handles session resume with automatic fallback to conversation history
- Manages idle timeouts and connection cleanup
- Captures chart specs and tool outputs for frontend rendering
- Supports both Claude and non-Claude (OpenAI) models as the orchestrator
- Integrates Langfuse tracing for observability
- Uses explicit charting constraints and result directives to enforce text-chart interleaving across all model types

